
@Blog.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7125

### ============================================
### USERS
### ============================================

### Registrar usuário
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "João",
  "lastName": "Silva",
  "email": "joao.silva@email.com",
  "password": "Senha123"
}

### Registrar o mesmo usuário novamente - deve falhar
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "João",
  "lastName": "Silva",
  "email": "joao.silva@email.com",
  "password": "Senha123"
}

### Cadastro inválido - deve retornar 400
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "",
  "email": "email-invalido",
  "password": "123"
}